# SaaS Pricing Model for AI Content Creation

## Tier Structure Overview

| Feature | Free Tier | Basic Tier | Creator Tier | Professional Tier |
|---------|-----------|------------|-------------------|-------------------|
| **Monthly Price** | €0 | €24.99 (24.99*12=€299.88) | €39.99 (39.99*12=€479.88) | €59.99 (59.99*12=€719.88) |
| **Annual Price** | €0 | €19.99/month (€239.88) | €34.99/month (€419.88) | €49.99/month (€599.88) |
| **Tokens per Month** | 300 | 2,500 | 6,500 | 10,000 |
| **Max Scenes per Job** | 5 (Consistent Content Material) | 13 (For YouTube Shorts and Tiktok) | Up to 20 (Long Image Story) | Unlimited (All Video duration options) |
| **Max Jobs per Month** | 10 | 45 | Unlimited | Unlimited |
| **Video Quality** | - | 540p | 540p | 720p |
| **Content Types** | Image, Text, Voice | Image, Voice, Animation, Video, Music | All | All |
| **Recreation Option (not yet implemented)** | Disabled | Disabled | Enabled (Only Images, Voice and Music) | Enabled (All Content Types) |
| **Script Settings** | Disabled | Enabled | Enabled | Enabled |
| **Visual Selection** | 2 (One Realistic, One Abstract) | 9 Visuals | Unlimited | Unlimited |
| **Voice Selection** | 3 Standard | 9 Voices | Unlimited | Unlimited |
| **Assembly Templates Selection** | 3 Standard | 10 Templates | Unlimited | Unlimited |
| **Watermark for Assembly** | Yes | No | No | No |
| **Support** | Community | Community | Email (24h) | Email (24h) |

- Settings (which is allowed / which not) for each option (script, visual, voice, assembly) are directly set in the configuration json files for each option (e.g. template-select-option.json with property planId). Higher plans always include the lower plans ids.

